# Trivy waivers (ADR 009). One advisory id per line, each with a comment above it giving the
# reason, who accepted it and a review date. A waiver without a reason is not accepted in review.

# prom/alertmanager v0.34.1 (the newest release) is built with Go and modules that have these
# fixes upstream but no Alertmanager release yet. Exposure: only Prometheus reaches it, on the
# private Docker network (no published port); its only outbound connections are TLS to the
# hospital's mail server and Telegram. Accepted by the OPD Saathi team on 23 Oct 2026; each
# entry expires on 30 Nov 2026, when the scan fails again until Alertmanager is upgraded.
